# OAuth Refresh Token Encryption - Key Rotation Support
# SESSION_SECRET_OLD and KEY_VERSION_OLD are used during key rotation for graceful migration
# Leave empty in normal operation. Set only when rotating SESSION_SECRET.
# Rotation process:
# 1. Set SESSION_SECRET_OLD to current SESSION_SECRET value
# 2. Change SESSION_SECRET to new value
# 3. Set KEY_VERSION_OLD to current KEY_VERSION (default: v0)
# 4. Optionally set KEY_VERSION to new version (default: v1)
# 5. After rotation period (7-30 days), remove SESSION_SECRET_OLD and KEY_VERSION_OLD
# SESSION_SECRET_OLD=
# KEY_VERSION=v1
# KEY_VERSION_OLD=v0

